## Artifact and Script Locations

Every path and directory tree this runbook uses is defined here, once. Later sections refer back to these names instead of redrawing them.

Primary script:

```text
$FRACTOGENESIS_HOME/bin/{{PRIMARY_SCRIPT}}          # entrypoint
```

Related scripts, alphabetical:

```text
$FRACTOGENESIS_HOME/.internal/{{HELPER}}            # helper -- called by the entrypoint
{{EXTERNAL_TOOL}}                                   # external helper -- not part of this toolkit
```

Artifact root:

```text
$REIMAGE_ARTIFACT_ROOT/{{ARTIFACT_DIR}}/            # what this runbook writes here
```

Input evidence built by earlier phases:

```text
$REIMAGE_ARTIFACT_ROOT/{{INPUT_DIR}}/               # written by {{SOURCE_RUNBOOK}}.md
```

