### Bundle Layout

<!--
One tree per root here -- normally just $REIMAGE_ARTIFACT_ROOT/, and a second
block only when the runbook genuinely writes into another root. Expand every
directory this runbook WRITES INTO and nothing else -- a directory it merely
reads is named in the labelled block above and is not expanded. Sort
alphabetically at every level.

Collapse omitted siblings AT EVERY LEVEL to a single `...` entry, one per
contiguous run of omissions: before the first shown entry when it is not
alphabetically first among its siblings, between two shown entries that are not
adjacent, and after the last shown entry when it is not alphabetically last. A
level where nothing is omitted gets no `...` at all.

A run-indexed category has this shape. `official/` holds one pointer file per
lineage; `MANIFEST.md` is append-only and owned by .internal/artifact-runs.sh;
`sign-offs/` appears only where the phase has answered rows.
-->

```text
$REIMAGE_ARTIFACT_ROOT/
├── ...
├── {{ARTIFACT_DIR}}/
│   ├── MANIFEST.md
│   ├── official/
│   │   └── {{CONTEXT}}.txt
│   ├── runs/
│   │   └── {{CONTEXT}}-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS/
│   │       ├── README.md
│   │       └── ...
│   └── sign-offs/
│       └── {{CONTEXT}}-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.md
└── ...
```

